# Watchdog stuck runs

When the user asks about runs, jobs, queue status, restarts, or whether ensemble members are progressing, also check for watchdog-held failures:

```bash
python3 ensemble_running/watchdog/restart_watchdog.py --list-stuck
```

(from `drought-ensemble/` with project config defaults).

If any `stuck_same_year` targets appear, tell the user clearly: those sequences failed twice on the same year tip and will **not** be auto-resubmitted until the sequence tombstone under `domains/<domain>/raw_runs/.watchdog_tombstones/` is cleared (after they inspect the error).
